  "content": "```html\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Animals/BH_More_Animals_Header.webp\" width=\"2119\" height=\"712\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">你是真正的动物愛好者嗎？你也喜歡玩有魔塊的Minecraft嗎？那麼這個包就是為你而生的！More Animals不僅增加了新的動物，它是一整套全新的遊戲體驗，但完全忠實於原版精髓，確實添加了一百多種新動物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">除了增加各種各樣的動物，大部分都很真實，例如大象、鱷魚、長頸鹿或獅子等等，我們還添加了大量模塊以提升遊戲體驗。我們相信你會玩得很開心！當然你也可以加入你喜歡的模塊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Animals/BH_More_Animals_Summary.webp\" width=\"2119\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">More Animals的目標只是增加遊戲和平生物的種類，特別是現實生活中的動物和各種棲息地，這將使遊戲更加精彩。無疑，這是動物愛好者的理想模塊包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🔝 你會享受到完全改進的遊戲體驗，但一直以來都保持着原版的視覺風格，你會覺得你一直在玩Minecraft。當然，這些模塊會徹底提升你的遊戲體驗，比如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>AmbientSounds</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rightclickharvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>RightClickHarvest</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Inventory HUD+</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-highlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Item Highlighter</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>AttributeFix</strong></span></a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Jade</strong></span></a>等等許多模塊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🦒 這個模塊包的目標是增加動物數量，因此傳說中的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Alex's Mobs</strong></span></a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Aquaculture 2</strong></span></a>不能缺少，雖然有很多其他動物模塊，例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>More Axolotl Variants</strong></span></a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duckling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Duckling</strong></span></a>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🏔️ 探索大量新的生態系統和野生動植物，感謝著名的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong></span></a>或新的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Alex's Caves</strong></span></a>，拓展了Minecraft洞穴的世界觀。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">☠️ 許多新動物，但也有令人印象深刻的敵敵，向<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/huntersreturn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Hunter's Return</strong></span></a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mutant Monsters</strong></span></a>問候。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🪑 但這還不是全部...這個超過200個模塊的包添加了很多你會很開心的經典內容，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Macaw's</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yungnickyoung/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>YUNG's</strong></span></a>或精彩的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/security-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Security Craft</strong></span></a>模塊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🤾 不要忘記它也支持多人遊戲！所以叫你的朋友來，告訴他們這個模塊包正在等著他們...你可以使用如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Simple Voice Chat</strong></span></a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emojiful\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Emojiful</strong></span></a>等模塊！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">😎 注意已經添加了很多優化模塊，你不需使用OptiFine，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xenon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Xenon</strong></span></a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Oculus</strong></span></a>已被包含，以便你可以使用你喜歡的着色器...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你需要一個服務器和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Animals/BH_More_Animals_Promo.webp\" width=\"2119\" height=\"314\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你在尋找一臺和你的朋友一起玩任何modpack的服務器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span>是你的解決方案！他們提供價效比最高的Minecraft服務器，如果你點擊<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個連結</a></span></strong>並將使用\"Lupin\"代碼，可獲得25%折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Animals/BH_More_Animals_FAQ.webp\" width=\"2119\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>Minecraft載入中？你進入世界但FPS很低嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">請確保<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmundominecraft.net%252fen%252fallocate-more-ram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">增加RAM</strong></span>，如果需要它。大多數問題都是由於此原因造成的。如果你使用CurseForge應用程式，只需點擊配置文件選項，取消選中使用預設記憶體系統並向右移動滑塊（我們建議至少5GB或5120MB）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果你看到仍然不夠，就繼續增加RAM！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你的伺服器是否有錯誤？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">不幸的是，當你在本地設置服務器，或使用我未推薦的宿主服務時，這個模塊包可能無法正常運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模塊包在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>上運行良好，所以我強烈建議使用這樣的服務器。如果你通過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>購買並使用代碼\"Lupin\"，你也會獲得25%折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請注意，我們推薦此模塊包的最低RAM為7GB。如果玩家人數較多，應該考慮進一步增加RAM。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>All our Themed modpacks:</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/essentials-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Essentials Mods [NeoForge/Forge/Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/animals-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Animals [NeoForge/Forge]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/biomes-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Biomes [NeoForge/Forge]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/decorations-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Decorations [NeoForge/Forge]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/more-fps-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">More FPS [NeoForge/Forge/Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/realistic-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Realistic [NeoForge/Forge]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Animals/BH_More_Animals_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"2119\" height=\"210\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/558/more-animals-1.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1417\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/561/more-animals-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/559/more-animals-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/604/more-animals-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n```",
